const artistEnDescription='Eran Yerushalmi, known professionally as CHIEF, is a Tel Aviv-based Israeli fine art photographer who photographs and edits exclusively on iPhone.';
const artistEnSchema={"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ProfilePage","@id":`${artistEnUrl}#page`,url:artistEnUrl,name:artistEnTitle,description:artistEnDescription,inLanguage:"en",dateModified:"2026-09-21T21:30:00+03:00",mainEntity:{"@id":`${site}/#artist`},primaryImageOfPage:{"@id":`${site}/#artist-portrait`},isPartOf:{"@id":`${site}/#website`}},artistSchema]};
const artistEn=`<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head>${commonHead(artistEnTitle,artistEnDescription,artistEnUrl,'/assets/eran-yerushalmi-chief-fine-art-photographer-portrait.jpg')}<link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="${artistEnUrl}"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="he" href="${artistHeUrl}"><script type="application/ld+json">${JSON.stringify(artistEnSchema)}</script></head><body class="seo-body">${header}<main class="seo-main"><article class="guide-he artist-profile-en"><p class="guide-kicker">OFFICIAL BIOGRAPHY · ERAN YERUSHALMI · CHIEF · TEL AVIV</p><h1>Eran Yerushalmi <span>(CHIEF)</span></h1><p class="guide-intro">Eran Yerushalmi, known professionally as CHIEF, is an Israeli fine art photographer based in Tel Aviv. He photographs and edits his work exclusively on iPhone, exploring light, reflection, movement and unexpected encounters in the city, by the sea and through the human figure.</p><figure class="artist-profile-portrait"><img src="${artistPortrait}" alt="Eran Yerushalmi (CHIEF), Tel Aviv-based iPhone fine art photographer" width="768" height="1024"><figcaption>Eran Yerushalmi (CHIEF)</figcaption></figure><section><h2>It began with a photograph of his daughter</h2><p>CHIEF began photographing his daughter when he got his first iPhone. Through those everyday moments, he fell in love with its camera and its possibilities. He gradually took that practice outside the home, into the streets and onto the shoreline, continuing to work with the iPhone.</p><p>The iPhone remains his tool for both photography and editing. Observation, timing and direct encounters with the world shape the work.</p></section><section><h2>Photographic practice</h2><p>His work moves between street photography, seascapes, portraits and fine art studies of the human figure. Through natural light, perspective and reflections, familiar places and ordinary objects take on an unexpected presence. His practice is rooted in direct photographic encounters rather than digitally constructed scenes.</p></section><section><h2>Exhibitions and recognition</h2><p>CHIEF won the “Photos of the Season” photography competition associated with Big Brother Israel. Dated exhibition notices published in 2014 document the award. The historical exhibition FANTASEA explored the sea, the desert and inspiration drawn from Salvador Dalí; it is one chapter in a practice that continues through the current series shown here.</p><p><a href="/press/#big-brother-award">View the award documentation and exhibition archive →</a></p></section><section><h2>Published photography</h2><p>His work and photography have appeared through Channel 13, Ynet and Yedioth Ahronoth, N12, Mako, Maariv, Walla, Israel Hayom, Time Out and Artsy. The Tel Aviv–Yafo Municipality has published his photographs on its official social channels since 2013.</p><p><a href="/press/">Read the original features and publications →</a></p><p><a href="/stories/tel-aviv-through-chief/en/">Tel Aviv through CHIEF’s lens →</a></p></section><section><h2>The official collection</h2><p>eranchief.com is the official website and current catalogue of CHIEF. Explore original photographic works, signed limited editions and the rotating monthly Paper Edition.</p><p><a href="/#collection">Explore the collection →</a> · <a href="/paper-edition/">Paper Edition →</a></p></section><section><h2>Follow CHIEF</h2><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/eranychief/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Instagram · eranychief</a> · <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dylan_tlv/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Instagram · dylan_tlv</a> · <a href="https://www.facebook.com/chieferanyerushalmi/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Facebook · CHIEF</a></p><p><a href="${artistHeUrl}" lang="he" hreflang="he">לביוגרפיה בעברית</a></p><p>Updated 20 September 2026.</p></section></article></main></body></html>`;
